cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper for the scientific method, this repository for the generation and plotting code, and the separate Zenodo record for the archived data."
type: software
title: "Generation and plotting code for entanglement spectra in a dirty Weyl semimetal"
authors:
  - family-names: "Mohr"
    given-names: "Vinícius"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vimohr/dirty-weyl-entanglement"
url: "https://github.com/vimohr/dirty-weyl-entanglement"
abstract: >-
  Python and Eigen/OpenMP generators, plotting and numerical validation scripts,
  archive verification, and source provenance for clean and disordered
  half-filling entanglement spectra. The archived HDF5 spectra and density-of-states
  tables have a separate Zenodo dataset DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.23300020.
keywords:
  - entanglement spectrum
  - Weyl semimetal
  - disorder
  - HDF5
